[{'severity':'medium','lines':'29–32','finding':'The returned cyclic_first_order_green_resolvents_needed_at_least label is broader than what this function constructs. It follows only after an external identification of each permitted cyclic first-order resolvent kernel with a rank-one Hankel sequence on this no-wrap interval. Arbitrary reordered/gauged Green layers or products are not certified.'},{'severity':'low','lines':'35–56','finding':'q<=0 is not rejected before max([]).'}],
